WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
Welcome to Own Your Semester. I’m Brian Kennedy

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.760
Jr. Your goal is a two-week study and

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.440
assignment plan. Choose one assignment, confirm its deadline,

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.480
and schedule the next small action. Keep your

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.120
work private, record what you tried, and set

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.560
a review date. Academic results depend on context

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.440
and action; no grade or admission outcome is

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:22.000
promised.
